    <Citation_Information>
      <publication_year>2025</publication_year>
      <description>Sketched map of the Apollo 15 landing site and       
        lunar rover traverse map.  The thick lines indicate the paths taken       
        by the astronauts during the three EVAs (Extra-Vehicular Activity).       
        Numbered spots indicate sampling stations along the individual            
        traverses.  The diagram is based on the Apollo 15 Traverses Lunar         
        Photomap Edition 2, Sheet 41B4S4[25].  It is available at the Lunar       
        and Planetary Institute's Apollo Landing Sites website                    
        http://www.lpi.usra.edu/publications/slidesets/apollolanding/.</description>
